// Sunday evening: Kai arrives at Sato House, meets Mrs. Sato and Mochi, walks
// down Hikari Street and sees Luna through the window of the Moonbean Cafe.
//
// Rows: pos y 827 / 877 / 927 from x 252. Narration is pale blue
// (tint 0.78,0.86,1), speech cream (tint 1,0.96,0.9).

str pro1a
    en "Sunday evening. Two hours on the train from the countryside, one suitcase. Kaminato: a harbour city of steep streets, sea wind and a million lights."
str pro2a
    en "Number 12, Hikari Street. Sato House. Home for the next four years."
str pro3a
    en "You must be Kai! Welcome, welcome. I'm Mrs. Sato, your landlady."
str pro4a
    en "Nice to meet you, Mrs. Sato. Thank you for having me."
str pro5a
    en "Polite boy. Good. Rent is due on the first, the door locks at midnight, and no loud music after ten. Mochi gets very upset."
str pro6a
    en "Mochi?"
str pro7a
    en "My shiba. The real owner of this building. And if you ever need pocket money, I always have chores. Fifteen dollars each."
str pro8a
    en "Fifteen dollars... I'll remember that. My wallet is not exactly heavy."
str pro9a
    en "Go on, take a walk before dark. Hikari Street is prettiest at sunset."
str pro10a
    en "Down the street, warm light spills from a small cafe on the corner. MOONBEAN CAFE, says the sign. It smells of roasted beans and caramel."
str pro11a
    en "Behind the window, a girl in a brown apron is writing the specials on a chalkboard."
str pro12a
    en "She laughs at something, tucks a strand of chestnut hair behind her ear... ...and for a second, Kai forgets how to breathe."
str pro13a
    en "(...Okay. New city, new start. Maybe I'll try their coffee.)"
str pro14a
    en "That night, among unopened boxes, Kai makes a plan for the week."
str pro15a
    en "Mornings are for college. Afternoons and evenings are his to spend. The cafe costs $5 a visit. Mrs. Sato pays $15 for chores. There is a quiz on Friday."
str pro16a
    en "(Fifteen dollars, a timetable, and a coffee shop I can't stop thinking about.)"

ui sPro modal=false
    if dlg::line == 1
        text pro1a pos=252,827 width=1440 tint=0.78,0.86,1,1
    if dlg::line == 2
        text pro2a pos=252,827 width=1440 tint=0.78,0.86,1,1
